---
import { Paintbrush, Code2, Layout } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="services" class="sm:px-8 px-6 bg-slate-50/70 border-t border-slate-200/80 py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-bahia-cyan uppercase tracking-widest font-geist-mono">
          Especialidades
        </span>
        <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-slate-200"></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4">
        Habilidades &amp; Competências
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-500 font-geist-mono max-w-2xl">
        Design systems institucionais, arquitetura de interfaces e desenvolvimento moderno integrados em uma experiência fluida.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1: UI/UX Design -->
      <div class="group bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-bahia-cyan/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="h-48 mb-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div class="w-full h-full bg-white shadow-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-200/80 p-3 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div class="flex gap-1.5">
                <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-bahia-red/80"></div>
                <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400/80"></div>
                <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-bahia-cyan/80"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-2">
                <div class="h-2 w-1/3 bg-slate-200 rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                  <div class="h-16 bg-slate-50 rounded border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-bahia-cyan-100 border border-bahia-cyan/30"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="h-16 bg-slate-50 rounded border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-bahia-red/10 border border-bahia-red/30"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold font-geist-mono mb-4 badge-bahia-cyan">
            <Paintbrush class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Design de Interfaces
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">UX/UI &amp; Design Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed font-geist-mono">
            Criação de ecossistemas visuais completos, bibliotecas de componentes reutilizáveis e fluxos de navegação sem fricção focados no usuário.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Web Development -->
      <div class="group bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-bahia-indigo/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="h-48 mb-6 bg-slate-900 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative border border-slate-800 flex flex-col">
            <div class="flex items-center px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60">
              <div class="flex gap-1.5">
                <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-bahia-red"></div>
                <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></div>
                <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></div>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-geist-mono ml-3">Component.astro</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 font-geist-mono text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-relaxed overflow-hidden">
              <span class="text-bahia-indigo">const</span> <span class="text-bahia-cyan">Apresentacao</span> = () =&gt; &#123;<br/>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-bahia-indigo">return</span> (<br/>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;<span class="text-bahia-red">GovBahia</span> <span class="text-amber-300">theme</span>=<span class="text-emerald-400">"digital"</span>&gt;<br/>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;<span class="text-bahia-red">DesignSystem</span> /&gt;<br/>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/<span class="text-bahia-red">GovBahia</span>&gt;<br/>
              &nbsp;&nbsp;)<br/>
              &#125;
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold font-geist-mono mb-4 badge-bahia-indigo">
            <Code2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Frontend &amp; Astro
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Desenvolvimento Web Moderno</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed font-geist-mono">
            Aplicações ultra-rápidas construídas com Astro, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript e WebGL para máxima performance e acessibilidade.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Brand Identity & Colors -->
      <div class="group bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-bahia-red/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="h-48 mb-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 w-full max-w-[220px]">
              <div class="aspect-square rounded-full bg-[#008ABE] shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] text-white font-geist-mono font-bold" title="#008ABE (Cyan)">
                CYAN
              </div>
              <div class="aspect-square rounded-full bg-[#4D4C9D] shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] text-white font-geist-mono font-bold" title="#4D4C9D (Indigo)">
                INDIGO
              </div>
              <div class="aspect-square rounded-full bg-[#FF0337] shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] text-white font-geist-mono font-bold" title="#FF0337 (Red)">
                RED
              </div>
              <div class="col-span-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#008ABE] via-[#4D4C9D] to-[#FF0337] mt-2 shadow-inner"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold font-geist-mono mb-4 badge-bahia-red">
            <Layout class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Identidade Visual
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Paleta &amp; Branding Institucional</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed font-geist-mono">
            Sistemas visuais coesos orientados pelas diretrizes da marca Bahia, garantindo padronização cromática em todas as mídias.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
